  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(20 fotos) Julio Segura, chef del restaurante El M&oacute;n de Julio, ha reabierto este mi&eacute;rcoles la sesiones mensuales de &#39;Cocina en directo&#39; en el Mercado Municipal de Onda</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">, dentro del plan de dinamizaci&oacute;n que el Ayuntamiento ha encargado a la C&aacute;mara de Comercio de Castell&oacute;n.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/05/IMG_1044.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Segura ha cocinado en directo unas deliciosas habas con gambas, condimentadas tambi&eacute;n con alcachofas, ajos tiernos, piment&oacute;n dulce y albahaca.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatmondejulio/img_7761.jpg\" alt=\"img_7761\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatmondejulio/img_7762.jpg\" alt=\"img_7762\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatmondejulio/img_7765.jpg\" alt=\"img_7765\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatmondejulio/img_7766.jpg\" alt=\"img_7766\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatmondejulio/img_7767.jpg\" alt=\"img_7767\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatmondejulio/img_7770.jpg\" alt=\"img_7770\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><i